    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 400
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Six classifiers, one dataset, one split. The two moons interlock, so no straight line separates them. Logistic regression draws a straight line and scores 0.82. KNN, the random forest, the RBF SVM and the MLP bend their boundary and score 0.86 to 0.90. The depth-5 decision tree cuts with axis-aligned steps and scores 0.83. Raise noise on SyntheticDataset and watch the gap close.\n\n六個分類器、同一份資料、同一次切分。兩個月牙彼此交錯，沒有一條直線能把它們分開。邏輯斯迴歸只能畫直線，分數 0.82。KNN、隨機森林、RBF SVM 和 MLP 能讓邊界彎曲，分數落在 0.86 到 0.90。深度 5 的決策樹只能沿座標軸切出階梯，分數 0.83。把 SyntheticDataset 的 noise 調高，看差距如何縮小。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-split",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 340,
        "y": 1080
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "stratify keeps the two classes in the same proportion in train and test. All six classifiers read the same x_train / y_train and are scored on the same 120 test points, so the numbers are comparable.\n\nstratify 讓訓練集和測試集裡兩類的比例相同。六個分類器讀同一份 x_train / y_train，並在同樣的 120 個測試點上評分，所以數字可以直接比較。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "split",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 680
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
  ],
